## About Respond

Respond covers the actions taken once an incident has been detected: analysis, containment, communication and notification of affected parties.

## Key areas

- Incident handling plan and escalation
- Contain and stop ongoing attacks
- Internal and external communication
- Evidence preservation and analysis
